Package: soilhub
Title: R Client for the Global Soil Data Hub API
Version: 0.1.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Giuliano", "Langella", , "giuliano.langella@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Discover, read and export harmonised soil profile data (WoSIS,
    WISE, SOTER, SOTWIS) from the Global Soil Data Hub API, and publish
    derived values with the appropriate rights.
